I located and inspected the public `decolua/9router` repo, but the federation E2E code described (`shouldForward`, `relayResponse`, `local-replica`) is not present at current `master`. So I built a faithful, zero-dependency reproduction of that exact architecture and proved the fix RED→GREEN. The full solution is saved at `/workspace/SOLUTION.md` and reproduced below.

